# A window function that reads no column at all: the operator buffers batches without columns

query IIB
SELECT id, row_number() OVER () AS rn, p5 FROM wide WHERE id < 5 ORDER BY id;
----
0 1 true
1 2 false
2 3 false
3 4 true
4 5 false

